# The backend serves both the API and /uploads over https (self-signed dev
# cert) -- an https:// frontend page can't load an http:// resource (mixed
# content, silently blocked by the browser). Only set this if you actually
# need to point at a different backend; leave it unset to auto-match the
# page's own protocol/host.
VITE_API_URL=https://localhost:3001/api
